PLR 8.3: after a for loop over a non-empty sequence the loop
variable holds the LAST element. The early-exit scan encoding
loud-fails the post-loop read (TypeError not-subscriptable --
sound, never a pun). Acceptance: bind the row index to len-1 on
the no-match path so the read is exact.
